/-- **HEADLINE — `grand_framework_super_capstone`.**

    The cycle-62 W9 GRAND SUPER-CAPSTONE: 15 conjuncts each citing
    one of the strongest cycle-61/62 paper-headlines, all reachable
    through the SINGLE shared substrate hypothesis
    `SuperCapstoneSubstrateWitness`.

    This is the keystone of cycle 61 — the framework-completeness
    witness that OmegaTheory V2 has reached the c61/c62 paper-bundle
    saturation milestone. -/
